{
  "_comment": [
    "Channel layouts for tools/fixtures-from-paramsets.js.",
    "A paramset description dump only knows channel *types*, never channel indexes, so the",
    "indexes below are synthesised. They are consistent within a fixture (CHILDREN, PARENT and",
    "INDEX always agree) but they are not guaranteed to match the real device. Correct an entry",
    "from a listDevices dump of the real hardware when one is available.",
    "",
    "'order' lists the channel types after MAINTENANCE (which is always channel 0), 'counts' how",
    "many channels of that type follow. Device types without an entry get one channel per channel",
    "type, in the order they appear in the dump."
  ],
